  "_files_comment": "MEASURED 2026-09-20 (bean `frq2`), by running the pack nobody had ever run: this list produced a tarball of FOUR files — package.json, LICENSE, README.md, harness.config.example.json — and NO CODE. Two entries had moved under `cat-harness/` at the split and two named files that do not exist anywhere in the repository, so `bun pm pack` silently dropped four of six. A `files` entry that does not resolve is not a warning; it is a smaller package.",
